    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "uQBTf",
      "x": -753,
      "y": 2143,
      "name": "Note / Inventory List",
      "metadata": {
        "type": "note"
      },
      "fill": "$--muted-foreground",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 340,
      "content": "FLOW CONTEXT · Inventory tab (has items)\nHeader: title + add (+) → /item-form (create).\nSEARCH: filters name + category (case-insensitive). Clear (x) when non-empty.\nFILTERS: All / Out of stock (qty==0) / category chips. Active chip = primary fill; inactive = white + border.\nLIST: SectionList grouped by category (sorted), sticky headers off. Leaf icon emerald, uppercase label.\nROW: tap name → /item-form?itemId={id}. qty==0 → red 'Out of stock' badge (not in seed). qty==1 → amber 'Low stock'. Else qty number w-8.\nSTEPPERS: minus disabled @ qty 0 (opacity .3). minus → updateQty(-1)+log 'used'; plus → updateQty(+1)+log 'restocked'. Location right, w-20, '—' if none.\nEMPTY (no inventory): 'Add some groceries' + 'Click the button below to add an item' + Add new item button.\nNO RESULTS (filtered): search icon + 'No items found' + 'Try a different search or filter'.\nA11Y: 28px steppers (min touch 44 with hitSlop), chips 32px (small) — hittable area larger.\nMOTION: tab switch, list scroll.\nANALYTICS: inventory.add_item, inventory.filter, inventory.qty{delta}.",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "Tt39o",
      "x": -283,
      "y": 1275,
      "name": "Inventory / Empty",
