    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "oCHwd",
      "x": 187,
      "y": 2143,
      "name": "Note / Shopping To Buy",
      "metadata": {
        "type": "note"
      },
      "fill": "$--muted-foreground",
      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
      "width": 340,
      "content": "FLOW CONTEXT · Shopping (To Buy)\nSEGMENTED: To Buy (count) / Purchased (count). Active = white segment; count badge on active = primary fill.\nSUGGESTED: inventory predicted to finish ≤2 days (estimateFinishDate: history avg interval, stale restock >21d & ≤3, else category rate 1/day perishable vs 1/3 staple, only if finish ≤3d). Amber bulb + 'Predicted to finish {today|tomorrow|in N days}'. '+ Add' → addToShoppingList(name, id). Excludes already-queued items.\nTO BUY ROWS: empty checkbox (w-6 border-2 gray-300) → markAsPurchased. Steppers target_qty (minus disabled @1).\nEMPTY (no suggested & no to-buy): basket icon + 'Nothing to buy yet.' + Add item → opens add-item sheet.\nA11Y: checkbox ≥44 target, steppers w-7+hitSlop.\nMOTION: tab slide animation.\nANALYTICS: shopping.tab_selected, shopping.add_suggestion, shopping.mark_purchased, shopping.qty.\nDATA: seed has no shopping_list rows; suggested derived from inventory + consumption_logs (Orange Juice & Whole Milk logs).",
      "fontFamily": "Inter",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
